    "gitMarketplace.error.localUnreadable.changedDuringRead": "A file in {path} changed while Ave read it, so nothing from that read is used. Ave tries again at the next read.",
    "gitMarketplace.error.listUnreadable.unreadable": "Ave cannot open the list of sources you added, marketplaces/sources.json in the Ave data folder ({fsCode}), so it changes no source until it can. Make sure your account can read and write the file, or delete it, then restart Ave. Deleting it removes only the sources you added: the official and organization sources and your installed packages stay.",
    "gitMarketplace.error.listUnreadable.invalid": "The list of sources you added, marketplaces/sources.json in the Ave data folder, is not in the format Ave writes, so Ave changes no source until it is fixed. Fix the file (Copy details says what is wrong) or delete it, then restart Ave. Deleting it removes only the sources you added: the official and organization sources and your installed packages stay.",
