    "gitMarketplace.error.authRequired.tokenUnencrypted.setToken": "{host} needs sign-in, and this source uses http, so Ave sends no sign-in to it until you allow that. Choose Allow… on the source's row in Sources, then Set token….",
    "gitMarketplace.error.authRequired.tokenUnencrypted.entry": "{host} needs sign-in, and this address uses http, so the sign-in would travel unencrypted. Choose Check address again and confirm it, with the token under Access token.",
