                  description: 'Minimum Ave app version (plain SemVer MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, not a range) required to load this plugin. The host refuses to install (hard block before download) and refuses to activate (skips start(), surfaces a non-dismissable "needs newer app" state) when the running app is older. Omit for no minimum (compatible with all app versions).'
